<blockquote class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-size-36 ndx-climax">
  "I've reviewed your photo; environmental health will visit Wednesday, ref ABC123."
</blockquote>

<p class="govuk-body">That sentence is the climax this scenario exists to demonstrate. It's what a council CIO will remember and what a Director of Customer Services will photograph for their CIO.</p>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">What to do</h3>

<ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number govuk-list--spaced">
  <li>Open the companion SPA, add <code>?step=4</code> to the URL. <strong>All three panes brighten.</strong></li>
  <li>From the same phone you dialled from in Step 1, dial the +44 800 number again.</li>
  <li>Listen.</li>
</ol>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">What's happening</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">When the call lands, the contact flow calls <code>cases:SearchCases</code> filtered by <code>customer_phone_number == sender_phone</code> AND <code>status: open</code> AND <code>lastUpdated > now() - 1h</code>. It finds your existing case (the one Step 1 created and Step 3 updated with the photo description). It reads back a single sentence assembled from the case's structured fields and the multimodal description.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">All three panes are bright now: live transcript on the left (your dial-back acknowledged), Connect Case in the middle (one ticket, no duplicates), and the WhatsApp simulator on the right showing your earlier photo attachment.</p>

